=== decision_cost microbench v4 (correlated workload, IndexedHeap, p50/p99/MAX) ===

--- (0) IndexedHeap correctness property test (vs dict+min reference) ---
{"ops": 360000, "seeds": 30, "interior_removes": 54449, "drains_to_empty": 30, "violations": 0}
  (full invariants checked after EVERY op; interior remove / remove-min / drain exercised)

--- workload realism: page occupancy + reclaimable distribution ---
{"n_pages": 1000, "n_events": 54807, "frac_free_pages": 0.009, "frac_full_pages": 0.991, "frac_partial_pages": 0.0, "mean_reclaimable_per_sample": 9.2}
{"n_pages": 4000, "n_events": 89488, "frac_free_pages": 0.032, "frac_full_pages": 0.968, "frac_partial_pages": 0.0, "mean_reclaimable_per_sample": 127.9}
(bimodal: free+full >> partial; reclaimable pages are RARE under pressure)

--- (2) per-op maintenance: IndexedHeap vs LRU (batch-timed, 3 seeds, P=4000) ---
{"seed": 0, "maintenance_events": 61567, "inc_ns_per_ev": 1298.1, "lru_ns_per_ev": 320.9, "ratio_inc_over_lru": 4.04}
{"seed": 1, "maintenance_events": 62340, "inc_ns_per_ev": 1271.0, "lru_ns_per_ev": 339.4, "ratio_inc_over_lru": 3.74}
{"seed": 2, "maintenance_events": 60756, "inc_ns_per_ev": 1196.6, "lru_ns_per_ev": 273.7, "ratio_inc_over_lru": 4.37}
per-op ratio Indexed/LRU (batch-timed): [4.04, 3.74, 4.37]  (target <= ~3x)
{"bare_idx_ns": 777.3, "bare_lazy_heapq_ns": 616.7, "bare_od_ns": 189.5, "idx_over_lazy(algorithm)": 1.26, "idx_over_od(full_constant)": 4.1}
  (idx/lazy ~2x = algorithm; idx/od ~5x = mostly Python-sift vs C; a C-backed indexed heap would likely beat lazy on per-op too)
  perf_counter_ns() call floor on this box: ~56 ns (=> sub-µs query numbers are ~half timer overhead)

--- (1)+(3) query latency vs P: LazyHeap(prod) vs IndexedHeap(fix) vs naive O(P) ---
  reporting p50 / p99 / MAX (the mean hides the lazy-delete O(P) spikes):
{"n_pages": 1000, "lazy_p50": 260, "lazy_p99": 4170, "lazy_MAX": 1588186, "idx_p50": 140, "idx_p99": 280, "idx_MAX": 4840, "naive_mean": 40633.2, "viols_lazy": 0, "viols_idx": 0}
{"n_pages": 4000, "lazy_p50": 310, "lazy_p99": 7670, "lazy_MAX": 5698454, "idx_p50": 160, "idx_p99": 400, "idx_MAX": 11100, "naive_mean": 172399.3, "viols_lazy": 0, "viols_idx": 0}
{"n_pages": 16000, "lazy_p50": 560, "lazy_p99": 14460, "lazy_MAX": 70532633, "idx_p50": 260, "idx_p99": 570, "idx_MAX": 50900, "naive_mean": 750920.3, "viols_lazy": 0, "viols_idx": 0}
  (LazyHeap MAX = real O(P) trim spike, scales with P; IndexedHeap MAX is
   scheduler JITTER not peek cost — batched worst per-call ~125ns, sub-µs)

--- (1b) structural complexity vs P (IndexedHeap): peek O(1), maintenance O(log P) ---
{"n_pages": 1000, "peek_p50_ns": 140, "maintenance_ns_per_ev": 1251.9}
{"n_pages": 4000, "peek_p50_ns": 140, "maintenance_ns_per_ev": 982.3}
{"n_pages": 16000, "peek_p50_ns": 130, "maintenance_ns_per_ev": 1140.4}
{"n_pages": 64000, "peek_p50_ns": 140, "maintenance_ns_per_ev": 2870.2}
{"n_pages": 256000, "peek_p50_ns": 140, "maintenance_ns_per_ev": 3194.4}
  (peek flat O(1); maintenance O(log P): ~0.7µs@1k -> ~2.3µs@256k, all << ms step)

